<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Valety | AI-Powered Engineering Audit</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <style>
        body { background-color: #0f172a; }
        .glass { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="text-slate-200 font-sans leading-relaxed">

    <nav class="p-6 flex justify-between items-center max-w-6xl mx-auto">
        <div class="text-2xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 to-emerald-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">VALETY</div>
        <div class="hidden md:flex gap-8 text-sm font-medium opacity-70">
            <a href="#features" class="hover:text-blue-400 transition">Features</a>
            <a href="#security" class="hover:text-blue-400 transition">Security</a>
            <a href="mailto:amr.elfar@bravo-ds.com" class="hover:text-blue-400 transition">Partnership</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <header class="py-24 px-6 text-center">
        <div class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 mb-6 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-blue-400 uppercase bg-blue-400/10 border border-blue-400/20 rounded-full">
            Enterprise Grade AI
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6 tracking-tight">
            Stop <span class="text-blue-500">Scope-Bleed</span> <br>Before It Starts.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
            Automated technical audits for Engineering Proposals. Validate RFPs vs. Deliverables instantly via our <b>Zero-UI Telegram interface</b>.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
            <a href="VALETY_INSTALLER.exe" class="bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white px-10 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold shadow-lg shadow-blue-900/20 transition-all flex items-center justify-center">
                Download Service (.exe)
            </a>
            <a href="https://t.me/your_bot_link" class="glass text-white px-10 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold hover:bg-white/5 transition-all flex items-center justify-center">
                Try on Telegram
            </a>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono">v1.0.0 | Windows 10/11 x64 | Standalone Service</p>
    </header>

    <section id="features" class="py-20 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="glass p-8 rounded-2xl">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-500/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-blue-400">⚡</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Zero-UI Workflow</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">No new software to learn. Simply forward documents to the Valety Bot and receive professional audit reports in seconds.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="glass p-8 rounded-2xl">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-500/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-emerald-400">🛡️</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Local Security</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Standalone installation. All processing happens within your firm’s infrastructure. Your IP never hits a public cloud.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="glass p-8 rounded-2xl">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-purple-500/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-purple-400">📑</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">100% Traceability</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Every finding is linked to the exact page and paragraph. Built for Engineering Consultants who demand accuracy.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-20 px-6">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto glass p-12 rounded-3xl text-center border-blue-500/30">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Are you an AEC Consultant?</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-400 mb-8">Join our referral broker program. Earn <b>20% commission</b> by helping firms protect their margins with Valety.</p>
            <a href="mailto:amr.elfar@bravo-ds.com" class="text-blue-400 font-bold hover:text-blue-300">Contact Partner Relations →</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="py-10 text-center text-slate-600 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase">
        © 2026 VALETY BY AMR ELFAR | BRAVO HOSPITALITY SOLUTIONS
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
